-- One-off correction (docs/VOICE_AND_MUSIC.md): the 20 seeded original tracks get the moods chosen for them
-- (scripts/music/seed-lib.mjs SEED_MOODS; generated by moodUpdateSql). Only rows the seed made; no-op when none exist.
